cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: Physical-Project-mk2
abstract: >-
  Physical-Project-mk2 is an edge-to-cloud platform for physical AI at
  disaster-response and infrastructure sites. Sensors, legged robots, drones
  and 360-degree cameras publish to zone edge nodes; a central server routes
  business data through MQTT and Kafka into TimescaleDB and MySQL, routes
  metrics, logs and traces through OpenTelemetry to Prometheus, Loki and
  Tempo, and pushes live state and video to operator consoles and a Unity
  digital twin over WebSocket. Interfaces between parts are JSON Schema
  contracts. The central stack is reproducible with Docker Compose and is
  rebuilt and checked end to end on every pull request. Version
  1.0.0-rc.1 is a release candidate without authentication, RBAC or TLS.
type: software
authors:
